        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: the room smelled of a damp rag gone moldy, and i watched you shovel down
      yogurts and sweet cheese bars you'd picked up at twenty percent off in the
      cats' clearance sale.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 4
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'when that white, poisonous delight was gone, you set to work with practiced
      precision, slicing sausage and piling it onto thick, greasy slices of toast. '
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 5
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: mayonnaise dripped from your mustache, splattering your worn house shorts
      in foul little stains while you kept feeding your gut.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
